    "pre-existing 1985 wealth rises — and (in the highest tier) even flipping to mean wealth "
    "DECLINE. Income is NOT in the dataset, so the strata are operationalized as a clearly "
    "labelled PROXY via the 1985 composite wealth restricted to Black respondents in three "
    "tiers: Tier-1 (composite_wealth_1985 ≤ $0, N=1,316), Tier-2 ($0–$10,000, N=1,120), and "
