    f"${G('Tier2_modest','boot_med_dW_85_96'):,.0f} "
    f"(95% CI [${G('Tier2_modest','boot_lo95_dW_85_96'):,.0f}, "
    f"${G('Tier2_modest','boot_hi95_dW_85_96'):,.0f}], "
    "the CI excludes zero); OLS-implied Tier-2 mean gap "
    f"${implied['Tier2_modest']:,.0f}. "
